It contains code ported to PHP from the following projects, which are also
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- python-roborock
  https://github.com/Python-roborock/python-roborock
  Used for: login and cloud API (RoborockCloud/module.php), message protocol,
  encryption, local and MQTT transport (libs/RoborockProtocol.php) and the
  code tables of V1 devices (libs/RoborockCodes.php).

- vacuum-map-parser-roborock (Piotr Machowski)
  https://github.com/PiotrMachowski/Python-package-vacuum-map-parser-roborock
  Used for: parsing the map data (libs/RoborockMap.php).

The behaviour of the Home Assistant Roborock integration
(https://github.com/home-assistant/core, Apache License 2.0) served as a
reference; no code was taken from it.

All ported parts were rewritten in PHP and adapted for IP-Symcon.
